77
00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:24.450
So good.

78
00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:26.650
He's also in two Matrix movies, you guys.

79
00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.770
Oh, so you liked this.

80
00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:29.230
Uh-huh.

81
00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:29.650
Okay.

82
00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:30.290
This is great.

83
00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:30.910
This is good.

84
00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:36.410
And then finally, rounding out the cast is Elle McPherson as billionaire Charles

85
00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:39.310
Morse's wife, supermodel Mickey Morse.

86
00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:43.030
And you know Elle McPherson is a real-life supermodel.

87
00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:43.430
Mm-hmm.

88
00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:44.970
Here's a fact for you.

89
00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.390
The original title of this movie was Bookworm.

90
00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:52.770
But about three months before the movie was set to come out, the studio decided that it

91
00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:58.070
needed a more commercial title, something that really spoke to the suspense of the film.

92
00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.770
