93
00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:00.790
I agree.

94
00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:01.290
Mm-hmm.

95
00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:07.430
The role of Bob Green, played by Alec Baldwin, was originally offered to Harrison Ford and

96
00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:08.250
Dustin Hoffman.

97
00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:09.490
What?

98
