99
00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.390
No.

100
00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.590
Dustin Hoffman as Bob?

101
00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:14.430
As Bob.

102
00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:16.870
Well, no, I can't.

103
00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:21.630
