232
00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.770
You're the salt of the earth.

233
00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:47.470
You're the most excellent man.

234
00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:49.050
That's why I married you.

235
00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.150
And you're the only woman I've ever wanted.

236
00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:54.010
See what lucky guy you are.

237
00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.310
A billionaire who has everything he wants.

238
00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.310
To a good companion, a good friend, and a good sport.

239
00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:01.850
Got it.

240
00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:02.630
Okay.

241
00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:03.870
And right.

242
00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:07.770
A photographer who wants everything he has.

243
00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:08.990
Nice looking lady.

244
00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:10.650
Your wife?

245
00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:11.630
Yes.

246
00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:12.770
Why'd you ask?

247
00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.370
Just like to know who everybody is.

248
00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:17.050
Must be tough.

249
00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:18.150
All that money.

250
00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:20.670
Them knowing what people value you for.

251
00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.030
What do you value me for, Bob?

252
00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:23.530
I think your wife's pretty cute.

253
00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:26.010
So, how are you planning to kill me?

254
00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:42.800
Two rivals lost in the wilderness

255
00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:47.380
are forced to confront nature.

256
00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:51.300
What are we going to do?

257
00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:52.900
Am I supposed to have a plan?

258
00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.300
But they're about to discover

259
00:11:55.300 --> 00:12:00.760
nature isn't as dangerous as the nature of man.

260
00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.880
